                        "entry_id": "bac09d61-f041-3406-916c-e7f3ca6dc3f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who undergoes or underwent many a hardship, who suffers some great burden; a burdened, beleaguered, downtrodden man."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9024e15d-6315-4123-b281-9941b84b05fd",
                                "sense_id": "51fdfb26-a1d3-3d77-8981-29b91aee2a9b",
                                "text": "\"Archbiſhops, Biſhops,\" (ſo ſays Doctor Parr)\n\"By delta, Beta, merely, have been made :\n\"Why from the mitre then am I ſo far;\n\"So long a dray-horſe in this thundering trade ?\n\"O Pitt, ſhame on thee !—art thou ſtill to ſeek \"The ſoul of wiſdom in the ſound of Greek ?\""
                            }
                        ]
